;
; How Ticker files a caption the person saved, in MYRA: when it was shown
; (ms since 1970), who spoke (their number in the call, the media or the
; room), the source language (its place in xlate.languages, 0 not known)
; and how many characters it holds. Captions not saved are never filed.
^ZXTICKER(at:i15) = speaker:i3! ^ lang:i3! ^ chars:i4!
